# API App (`apps/api`)

## Route Structure

```
apps/api/src/app/api/
  [[...rest]]/route.ts        — catch-all for oRPC + OpenAPI
  auth/[...all]/route.ts      — dashboard Better Auth (/api/auth)
  admin-auth/[...all]/route.ts — admin Better Auth (/api/admin-auth)
```

Business logic lives in `packages/orpc/src/routers/`. Auth route handlers share `apps/api/src/lib/auth-route.ts` (CORS wrapper).

## Auth Endpoints

| Path | Instance | Cookie prefix | Used by |
|------|----------|---------------|---------|
| `/api/auth/*` | `dashboardAuth` | `harmonia-dashboard` | Dashboard (Spotify OAuth) |
| `/api/admin-auth/*` | `adminAuth` | `harmonia-admin` | Admin (email/password) |

Both share the same Postgres `user` / `session` tables but issue **separate session cookies**.

## Key Patterns

- CORS headers applied globally in `[[...rest]]/route.ts` — never add per-route CORS elsewhere
- CORS allowlist includes web, dashboard, admin, and API URLs (`apps/api/src/lib/cors.ts`)
- Errors serialised via `payload.ts` — never expose raw stack traces in production
- OpenTelemetry flushed before response on Vercel (`tracing.flushTelemetry()`)

## Trigger.dev

- Config: `apps/api/trigger.config.ts` — `maxDuration: 1800`, `dirs: ["./src/trigger"]`
- Task re-exports for CLI discovery: `apps/api/src/trigger/organize.ts`
- Dev script: `pnpm trigger:dev` (reads `HARMONIA_TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY` via `scripts/run-trigger-dev.mjs`)

## Environment

- Loaded via `scripts/with-root-env.mjs` (maps `HARMONIA_TRIGGER_*` → `TRIGGER_*`)
- Import env: `import { apiEnv } from "@harmonia/env/presets/api"`
